# MedTrack — Manufacturing ERP Context

**Project:** MedTrack Manufacturing ERP  
**Type:** Multi-tenant SaaS  
**Status:** Phase 0-4 (Active Development)  
**Canonical Reference:** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)

