## What is MedTrack?

MedTrack is a production-grade Manufacturing ERP system for mid-to-large manufacturing companies. It manages the complete product lifecycle:

- **Sales & Orders** — Customer orders, approval workflows, pricing, client portal
- **Inventory** — Multi-warehouse stock, batch/serial tracking, reservations, low-stock alerts
- **Manufacturing** — Work orders, BOMs, shop floor execution, production metrics
- **Procurement** — Purchase orders, GRNs, supplier management, subcontracting
- **Quality** — Inspections, non-conformance reports, QC approval workflows
- **Finance** — Invoicing, AR/AP tracking, standard costing
- **Reporting** — Real-time dashboards, analytics, MRP suggestions

