## 8 Bounded Contexts

| Context | Responsibility | Key Entities |
|---------|-----------------|--------------|
| **BOM** | Product configuration | Template, BOM, BOMLine |
| **Manufacturing** | Production execution | WorkOrder, Operation, Job |
| **Inventory** | Stock management | Material, Warehouse, Reservation |
| **Sales** | Customer orders | SalesOrder, Pricing |
| **Procurement** | Supplier management | PO, GRN, Subcontract |
| **Quality** | QC workflows | Inspection, NonConformance |
| **Finance** | Invoicing & ledger | Invoice, Payment, JournalEntry |
| **Tenant** | Auth & isolation | User, Role, Permission, Tenant |

Each context is **independent** (no direct coupling). Cross-context communication via **domain events**.

