## Key Manufacturing Rules (Non-Negotiable)

| Rule | Enforcement |
|------|-------------|
| **BOMs versioned** | New version = change to active BOM |
| **WO status linear** | DRAFT → RELEASED → STARTED → COMPLETED → CLOSED |
| **Materials reserved on WO release** | Reserved qty unavailable for others |
| **Materials consumed on WO completion** | Inventory updated |
| **Soft deletes only** | No hard deletes |
| **Audit trail always** | user_id, timestamp, tenant_id logged |

