## Mandatory Constraints

✅ **Multi-tenant filtering** on every query  
✅ **Soft delete check** on every SELECT  
✅ **Type hints** on all Python functions  
✅ **TypeScript strict mode** for all TS code  
✅ **Async/await** for all I/O operations  
✅ **DDD layer boundaries** respected  
✅ **CQRS separation** (commands ≠ queries)  
✅ **Error handling** (no silent failures)  
✅ **Structured logging** with context  
✅ **RBAC enforced** on endpoints  
✅ **Audit trail** on all mutations  
✅ **Tests ≥75% coverage** for new code  

---

## Critical Prohibitions (22 Total)

❌ Query without `tenant_id` filter  
❌ Skip soft delete check (`is_deleted = false`)  
❌ Hardcode secrets or configuration  
❌ Use blocking I/O in async context  
❌ Put business logic in route handlers  
❌ Rewrite existing modules  
❌ Bypass authentication/authorization  
❌ Silent exception handling (bare `except:`)  
❌ Force-push to main/develop branches  
❌ Leave debug print statements in code  
... [12 more in AGENTS.md section 22]

**See AGENTS.md for complete list.**

